<#-- BarRange -> High minus Low at the same bar. SQX SQ.Blocks.Indicators.BarRange: Chart.High(0) -
     Chart.Low(0). Native NinjaScript composite (parenthesised, can be used in comparisons).
     Output e.g.: (High[0] - Low[0]) -->
(<@printSeriesAt block shift><@printSeries block "High" /></@printSeriesAt> - <@printSeriesAt block shift><@printSeries block "Low" /></@printSeriesAt>)
